                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.24/156: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lay</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-04-19T09:00:00-05:00">April 19, 1931—9
                    a.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>24. Your 60, April 18, 10 p.m., first [<hi rendition="#italic">sic</hi>] portion.
                    You may inform President Colindres that bombs are not available.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
